---
/** Radio: three options on a sheet, one chosen: a round well filled with ink around a dot. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:176px; padding:18px 16px; --gap:14px">
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:10px"><i class="cover-check cover-check-round"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:72px"></i></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:10px"><i class="cover-check cover-check-round cover-check-on"></i><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:96px"></i></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:10px"><i class="cover-check cover-check-round"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:56px"></i></span>
</span>
